  "reply": "**Probably not.** The epic is SYN-1 Checkout v2: phone wallets and saved cards. It has 9 of its 14 issues still open, and the month ends in two days. Since early September the team has finished about one issue a week. At that pace, the trend chart below puts the last of them around mid-January. Even its earliest likely date is late December. That assumes no new work gets added to the epic.\n\nThe second chart shows how much of the estimated work is in To do, In progress and Done.\n\nThis thread's workstream is empty, so I searched outside it to find the epic and its history. I could only read what I found there, not change it. If you want to follow this epic over time, I can make a workstream from it."
}

Claims:
1. The reply gives no finish date, rate or forecast of its own: any it gives is the one Oriel's block caption states, or it says Oriel had too little history to forecast. A yes or no to the question that follows from Oriel's forecast is not one of its own.
